[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509136822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509136822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509136822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VjmO2","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T18:38:37Z","updated_at":"2024-11-30T18:38:37Z","body":"There might be another issue going on here. In a new project the delay time is 6900, so target ticks will be at least 6900, delay resolution shouldn't be more than 1000\r\n\r\nDid you happen to check the value of target ticks and the delay resolution? \r\n\r\nI'm wondering if somehow windows is returning a huge delay resolution ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509136822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509554922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509554922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509554922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VlMTq","user":{"login":"RossRothenstine","id":1435260,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUyNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1435260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine","html_url":"https://github.com/RossRothenstine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T03:48:43Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T03:54:53Z","body":"I did record some values here:\r\n\r\ncurrent_ticks = 3673038, target_ticks=1, delay_resolution = 1000. (target_ticks - delay_resolution) - current_ticks) = -3674037\r\n\r\nThis tracks the flow if target_ticks starts at zero and is initialized to current_ticks at the end of the first call of add_frame_delay. dynamic_delay is 1 so it is added to target_ticks of 0. \r\n\r\ncurrent_ticks will be some positive value, however the math of `target_ticks - delay_resolution` will result in an unsigned value of -999 which results in a uint64 underflow. The following if will result in true: `current_ticks < (target_ticks - delay_resolution`.\r\n\r\nCompare OS.cpp and OS_Window's logic blocks here, it seems like OS.cpp does not subtract delay resolution, therefore there is no underflow problem.\r\n\r\n```\r\n// OS.cpp\r\n\tif (dynamic_delay > 0) {\r\n\t\ttarget_ticks += dynamic_delay;\r\n\t\tuint64_t current_ticks = get_ticks_usec();\r\n\r\n\t\tif (current_ticks < target_ticks) {\r\n\t\t\tdelay_usec(target_ticks - current_ticks);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tcurrent_ticks = get_ticks_usec();\r\n\t\ttarget_ticks = MIN(MAX(target_ticks, current_ticks - dynamic_delay), current_ticks + dynamic_delay);\r\n\t}\r\n// OS_Windows.cpp\r\n\tif (dynamic_delay > 0) {\r\n\t\ttarget_ticks += dynamic_delay;\r\n\t\tuint64_t current_ticks = get_ticks_usec();\r\n\r\n\t\t// The minimum sleep resolution on windows is 1 ms on most systems.\r\n\t\tif (current_ticks < (target_ticks - delay_resolution)) {\r\n\t\t\tdelay_usec((target_ticks - delay_resolution) - current_ticks);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t// Busy wait for the remainder of time.\r\n\t\twhile (get_ticks_usec() < target_ticks) {\r\n\t\t\tYieldProcessor();\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tcurrent_ticks = get_ticks_usec();\r\n\t\ttarget_ticks = MIN(MAX(target_ticks, current_ticks - dynamic_delay), current_ticks + dynamic_delay);\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nMy naive understanding is that target_ticks is initialized statically to zero, and then is only replaced with current_ticks after this first call. So one must assume that on the first call that target_ticks will be zero. In this case it is 1 because dynamic_delay is added to it before the math.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509554922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509637807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509637807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509637807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vlgiv","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T08:44:03Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T08:45:56Z","body":"@clayjohn \r\ndelay_resolution is currently being computed as `delay_resolution = time_caps.wPeriodMin * 1000;` so it could potentially exceed 1000 on some machines.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509637807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509653435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509653435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509653435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VlkW7","user":{"login":"RossRothenstine","id":1435260,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUyNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1435260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine","html_url":"https://github.com/RossRothenstine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T09:25:53Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T09:25:53Z","body":"> Please use the following. The sleep time should be rounded down to avoid overshooting instead of subtracting.\r\n\r\nI'm a bit of a noob but I don't see any code in your comment for a suggestion, mind pasting it in? I'm also not against closing this if a maintainer has a better (less naive) solution. Mine is what unblocked my fork from starting up, but it is a naive fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509653435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509655185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509655185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509655185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VlkyR","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T09:30:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T09:30:39Z","body":"@RossRothenstine \r\n\r\nIt should be visible, but here it is in case it didn't show up for some reason.\r\n\r\n\t\tif (target_ticks > current_ticks + delay_resolution) {\r\n\t\t\tuint64_t delay_time = target_ticks - current_ticks - delay_resolution;\r\n\t\t\tdelay_time = (delay_time / delay_resolution) * delay_resolution;\r\n\t\t\tif (delay_time > 0) {\r\n\t\t\t\tdelay_usec(delay_time);\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509655185/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509659086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509659086","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509659086,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VllvO","user":{"login":"RossRothenstine","id":1435260,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUyNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1435260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine","html_url":"https://github.com/RossRothenstine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T09:41:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T09:41:31Z","body":"Sounds good, enacted the change and performed a quick smoke test on an empty project, and the project loaded fine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509659086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509659440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2509659440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2509659440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vll0w","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T09:42:42Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T13:32:15Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\nBy the way, the reason we need to round down is to cancel out the scheduler rounding up the sleep time and messing up the timing. If delay_resolution is 1000, then the delay_usec function within Windows already does the round down, but it won't be correct if delay_resolution is something like 2000.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509659440/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519455110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2519455110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2519455110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WK9WG","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T07:30:23Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T07:30:23Z","body":"Looks great! The final step before merging is to squash all the commits together so that the whole PR only contains 1 big commit with all your changes. We like to merge one commit at a time to keep the git history clean and navigable. \r\n\r\nIf you don't know how to do that, we have a helpful tutorial in the official documentation https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/community/contributing/pr_workflow.html#the-interactive-rebase","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519455110/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519503586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2519503586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2519503586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WLJLi","user":{"login":"RossRothenstine","id":1435260,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUyNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1435260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine","html_url":"https://github.com/RossRothenstine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RossRothenstine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T07:56:00Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T07:56:00Z","body":"> Looks great! The final step before merging is to squash all the commits together so that the whole PR only contains 1 big commit with all your changes. We like to merge one commit at a time to keep the git history clean and navigable.\r\n> \r\n> If you don't know how to do that, we have a helpful tutorial in the official documentation https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/community/contributing/pr_workflow.html#the-interactive-rebase\r\n\r\nDone and done.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519503586/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529393243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99871#issuecomment-2529393243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99871","id":2529393243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ww3pb","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:49Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:49Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529393243/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]